      "id": "is-section-using-cloth",
      "name": "IsSectionUsingCloth",
      "category": "Clothing Simulation",
      "signature": "IsSectionUsingCloth(Target, In Section Index, Check Corresponding Sections)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "USkeletalMesh*"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Section Index",
          "type": "Int"
        },
        {
          "name": "Check Corresponding Sections",
          "type": "Bool",
          "default": "true"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Checks whether the provided section is using APEX cloth. if bCheckCorrespondingSections is true\ndisabled sections will defer to correspond sections to see if they use cloth (non-cloth sections\nare disabled and another section added when cloth is enabled, using this flag allows for a check\non the original section to succeed)\n@param InSectionIndex Index to check\n@param bCheckCorrespondingSections Whether to check corresponding sections for disabled sections"
    },
